# The frontend SOT is a unified diff: context lines carry a leading space, so an EMPTY context
# line is legitimately a line containing exactly one space. `git diff --check` must not read that
# carrier format as trailing whitespace. The whitespace of the content it describes is checked at
# its source (packages/app, packages/ui), never through this file.
frontend/codepuppy-patches/*.patch -whitespace
